@startuml Vas-Vis Frame

title Vas-Vis - One Showcase Frame
autonumber

actor Operator
participant "TimelineUI" as TimelineUI
participant "main.cpp" as Main
participant "Timeline" as Timeline
participant "CharlesArm" as Arm
participant "FrameTrack" as Track
participant "OrbitCamera" as Camera
participant "Trail renderer" as Trails
participant "Scene renderer" as Scene
participant "raylib / ImGui window" as Window

Operator -> TimelineUI: Press Play or move the slider
TimelineUI -> Timeline: Update playback time
Main -> Timeline: Update(frame time)
Timeline --> Main: Current time

Main -> Arm: SetTime(current time)
Arm -> Track: Sample(current time)
Track --> Arm: Interpolated joint frame

Main -> Camera: Update input
Camera --> Main: Camera3D
Main -> Scene: Draw background, grid, and camera view
Main -> Trails: Draw enabled trails
Trails -> Track: Sample recent time range
Track --> Trails: Joint positions
Main -> Arm: Render current frame
Arm -> Scene: Draw bones and joints

Main -> TimelineUI: Render controls
Main -> Window: Present 3D scene and controls
Window --> Operator: Updated arm visualization

@enduml
